<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #eff0f4;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #12162f;
      }
      .wrap {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 20px 10px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      .card {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #f8f8fb;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header {
        background: transparent;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .top-svg {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        padding: 14px 14px 0;
      }
      .hero {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }
      .hero td {
        padding: 0;
      }
      .hero-left {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #283472 0%, #2f438f 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .hero-mid {
        width: 94px;
        background: #dfe4f5;
        border-top-left-radius: 999px;
        border-bottom-left-radius: 999px;
      }
      .hero-right {
        width: 78px;
        background: #dfe4f5;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .hero-icon {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 12px;
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        line-height: 34px;
        border: 1px solid #6f7db3;
        border-radius: 9px;
        color: #4a5ea4;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .header-band {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2d3475 0%, #3f4da1 35%, #d7d8e5 36%);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px 18px 8px;
      }
      .hello {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .muted {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #444a60;
      }
      .two-col {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }
      .two-col td {
        vertical-align: top;
        width: 50%;
        padding: 0 6px 0 0;
        height: 1px;
      }
      .panel {
        background: #eef0f6;
        border: 1px solid #e1e4ec;
        border-radius: 10px;
        min-height: 230px;
        height: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      .panel h4 {
        margin: 10px 12px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #323a7f;
      }
      .line {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0 12px 8px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #2f3448;
      }
      .event-image {
        margin: 0 12px 8px;
        height: 150px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #d5d8df;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .event-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .summary {
        margin-top: 14px;
      }
      .summary h4 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      table.detail {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      table.detail th {
        text-align: left;
        color: #5a6177;
        font-weight: 700;
        padding: 8px 4px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e7ef;
      }
      table.detail td {
        padding: 7px 4px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f5;
      }
      .right {
        text-align: right;
      }
      .total {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .total .value {
        color: #4d5eff;
        font-size: 30px;
        line-height: 1;
      }
      .ref {
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        background: #eceef8;
        border-radius: 9px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .cta {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 18px 0 6px;
      }
      .cta a {
        display: inline-block;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
        background: #5c70f7;
        padding: 10px 22px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .stats {
        margin-top: 14px;
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: separate;
        border-spacing: 10px 0;
      }
      .stats td {
        background: #eceef4;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 12px 8px;
      }
      .stats .label {
        color: #565d73;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .stats .value-blue {
        color: #4d5eff;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .stats .value-green {
        color: #0baf63;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .tips {
        margin-top: 14px;
        padding: 12px;
        border: 1px solid #f0b760;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #fff9ef;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #5f4b25;
      }
      .tips ol {
        margin: 8px 0 0 16px;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .tips li {
        margin: 2px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 18px;
        background: #dfe2ef;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 18px 16px;
      }
      .brand {
        font-size: 29px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #33439b;
      }
      .brand span {
        color: #11131e;
      }
      .tiny {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #5f6576;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
        .two-col,
        .two-col tbody,
        .two-col tr,
        .two-col td {
          display: block;
          width: 100%;
        }
        .two-col td {
          padding: 0;
          margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .total .value {
          font-size: 24px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="header">
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12px;">
            <tr>
              <td background="https://doeventimageeventbucket.s3.amazonaws.com/brand/email-header-bg.png" bgcolor="#2f366f" style="background-image:url('https://doeventimageeventbucket.s3.amazonaws.com/brand/email-header-bg.png');background-size:100% 100%;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:#2f366f;padding:0;border-radius:12px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td style="padding:18px 20px 18px 24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">&#161;Nueva venta!</td><td width="68" style="text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;padding:8px 12px 8px 8px;"><img src="https://doeventimageeventbucket.s3.amazonaws.com/brand/email-header-icon.png" width="36" height="36" alt="" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;" /></td></tr></table></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
          <p class="hello">Hola {{organizerName}}</p>
          <p class="muted">{{#if saleIntroText}}{{saleIntroText}}{{else}}El usuario {{buyerName}} compro {{ticketCount}} entrada(s) para tu evento.{{/if}}</p>

          <table class="two-col" role="presentation">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="panel">
                  <h4>Comprador</h4>
                  <p class="line"><strong>{{buyerName}}</strong></p>
                  {{#if buyerUsername}}<p class="line">{{buyerUsername}}</p>{{/if}}
                  {{#if buyerProfileImage}}
                    <p class="line"><img src="{{buyerProfileImage}}" alt="Perfil" style="width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;" /></p>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <div class="panel">
                  <h4>{{#if entityPanelTitle}}{{entityPanelTitle}}{{else}}Evento{{/if}}</h4>
                  <div class="event-image">
                    {{#if eventImage}}
                      <img src="{{eventImage}}" alt="Imagen del evento" />
                    {{else}}
                      <div style="line-height:150px;font-size:12px;color:#59607b;">Imagen del evento</div>
                    {{/if}}
                  </div>
                  <p class="line"><strong>{{eventName}}</strong></p>
                  <p class="line">{{eventDate}} {{eventTime}}</p>
                  <p class="line">{{eventLocation}}</p>
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <div class="summary">
            <h4>Detalle de la compra</h4>
            <table class="detail" role="presentation">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Categoria</th>
                  <th class="right">Cant</th>
                  <th class="right">Precio unit</th>
                  <th class="right">Subtotal</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {{#each categoryItems}}
                  <tr>
                    <td>{{category}}</td>
                    <td class="right">{{quantity}}</td>
                    <td class="right">{{unitPriceFormatted}}</td>
                    <td class="right">{{subtotalFormatted}}</td>
                  </tr>
                {{/each}}
                <tr>
                  <td>Subtotal ({{ticketCount}} {{#if itemCountLabel}}{{itemCountLabel}}{{else}}boletas{{/if}})</td>
                  <td class="right"></td>
                  <td class="right"></td>
                  <td class="right">{{subtotalFormatted}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>Cargo por servicio (10%)</td>
                  <td class="right"></td>
                  <td class="right"></td>
                  <td class="right">{{serviceFeeFormatted}}</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="total">
              <span>Total</span>
              <span class="value">{{#if totalAmountPlain}}$ {{totalAmountPlain}}{{else}}{{totalFormatted}}{{/if}}</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ref">
            <div><strong>Orden:</strong> {{orderReference}}</div>
            <div><strong>Referencia pasarela:</strong> {{gatewayReference}}</div>
            <div><strong>Fecha de pago:</strong> {{paymentDateDisplay}}</div>
          </div>

          <div class="cta">
            <a href="{{salesLink}}">Ver mis ventas</a>
          </div>

          <table class="stats" role="presentation">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="value-blue">{{ticketCount}}</div>
                <div class="label">{{#if itemCountLabel}}{{itemCountLabel}}{{else}}Boletas vendidas{{/if}}</div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <div class="value-green">{{#if orderRevenuePlain}}$ {{orderRevenuePlain}}{{else}}{{totalFormatted}}{{/if}}</div>
                <div class="label">Total ingresos</div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          {{#if purchaseAdvice}}
            <div class="tips">
              Sabemos lo importante que es destacar en un mercado competitivo. Por eso, queremos compartir contigo 4 tips que te ayudaran a maximizar las ventas de tus eventos:
              <ol>
                {{#each purchaseAdvice}}
                  <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
              </ol>
            </div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
          <div style="text-align:center;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1;">
            <img src="https://doeventimageeventbucket.s3.amazonaws.com/brand/email-logo-doevents.png" width="96" height="28" alt="Do.Events" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" />
          </div>
          <div class="tiny">mensaje automatico - no responder este correo</div>
          <div class="tiny">www.doeventsapp.com</div>
          <div class="tiny">© 2026 Do eventsapp. Todos los derechos reservados</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
